<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka's two-year bond auction oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka's two-year bond auction oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's latest auction on Thursday for 500 million rupees of two-year treasury bonds was heavily oversubscribed, the Central Bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>It gave the following details:</p>
<p>    Amount offered:	  500 million rupees</p>
<p>    Bids received:	   1.468 billion rupees</p>
<p>    Amount accepted:	 500 million rupees</p>
<p>    Coupon rate:	     13.5 percent per year</p>
<p>    Weighted avg yield:    13.44 percent per year</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (94-1-434319)</p>
</text>
